{"product_id":"dirty-genes-a-breakthrough-program-to-treat-the-root-cause-of-illness-and-optimize-your-health","title":"Dirty Genes: A Breakthrough Program to Treat the Root Cause of Illness and Optimize Your Health","description":"\u003cp\u003eInstant National BestsellerAfter suffering for years with unexplainable health issues, Dr. Ben Lynch discovered the root cause—“dirty” genes. Genes can be “born dirty” or merely “act dirty” in response to your environment, diet, or lifestyle—causing lifelong, life-threatening, and chronic health problems, including cardiovascular disease, autoimmune disorders, anxiety, depression, digestive issues, obesity, cancer, and diabetes.Based on his own experience and successfully helping thousands of clients, Dr. Lynch shows you how to identify and optimize both types of dirty genes by cleaning them up with targeted and personalized plans, including healthy eating, good sleep, stress relief, environmental detox, and other holistic and natural means.Many of us believe our genes doom us to the disorders that run in our families. But Dr. Lynch reveals that with the right plan in place, you can eliminate symptoms, and optimize your physical and mental health—and ultimately rewrite your genetic destiny.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ben Lynch\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062698148\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45905793450137,"sku":"12RF9780062698148","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691ac0564f230_Dirty_Genes_A_Breakthrough_Program_to_Treat_the_Root_Cause_of_Illness_and_Optimize_Your_Health.jpg?v=1763395559","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/dirty-genes-a-breakthrough-program-to-treat-the-root-cause-of-illness-and-optimize-your-health","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loo